{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05754","headline":"题石窟寺 · 宋昱","name":"题石窟寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵宇开金地，香龛凿铁围。\n影中羣象动，空里衆灵飞。\n檐牖笼朱旭，房廊挹翠微。\n瑞莲生佛步，瑶树挂天衣。\n邀福功虽在，兴王代久非。\n谁知云朔外，更覩化胡归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}